import LOEIS.A347.A347357.Defs

set_option linter.unusedVariables false

/-!
# A347357

The numbers visited on a square spiral when starting at 1 and then stepping to the smallest unvisited number that is not visible from the current number.

The 77 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A347357

/-- Known terms of `A347357`, starting at index `1`. -/
def data : List retType :=
  [1, 11, 6, 2, 14, 9, 3, 5, 7, 10,
    4, 8, 12, 18, 20, 17, 13, 15, 19, 21,
    23, 25, 22, 16, 24, 26, 28, 30, 27, 29,
